  "content": "\n\n```html\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1387229/description_c77d178a-67c8-4a5d-aafe-f549087bf783.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"988\" height=\"253\"></p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\">此套件運作需要核心模组<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecraft-transport-simulator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Vehicles</a>！<span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></span></h2>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\">此套件運作需要<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/transport-simulator-official-vehicle-set\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">IV 官方内容包</a>！</span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersive-vehicles-official-automobile-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CND1WIc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"210\" height=\"105\"></a></span><a href=\"http://patreon.com/IV_official_content_pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YoAsLwd.png\" alt=\"money spawner\" width=\"363\" height=\"105\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmtsiv_officialcontentpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SeJGwJ9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"249\" height=\"105\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CxBu34m.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"949\" height=\"59\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/transport-simulator-official-vehicle-set\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1DcZswS.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"945\" height=\"119\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-automotives\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dWes3um.png\" width=\"947\" height=\"119\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sign-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/aa043365df31607f6b7ac7c24df8e3efe06630a7_0.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"256\"></a><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cEQDpXv.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">OAmP 是 MTS/IV 官方内容包的首個擴展套件，致力於在 OCP 內容體系中新增更多交通工具，<br>維持您所熟悉的一貫高品質！<br>轟鳴的引擎、可點擊的內部細節、車身傾斜、累積泥土與結霜系統、<br>複雜的音效設計以及手工打造的模型與紋理！<br><br>從閃耀的跑車、旅行車，到賽車及更多車型，應有盡有！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br>所有車輛及零件均可在生存模式中製作。<br>請仔細查看下方展示的車輛！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cEQDpXv.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nb5LNxq.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"806\" height=\"96\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HYY4J8x.png\" alt=\"Escargot\" width=\"1395\" height=\"966\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/10f601fb2051e45154d2743f1b0e963e0326c7f3.png\" alt=\"Luxorama &amp; Merc\" width=\"1395\" height=\"966\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1c765f2a0c7ac52945dc0cfebf3cb3bb31670ddd.png\" alt=\"Cog &amp; Highwayman\" width=\"1395\" height=\"966\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cEQDpXv.png\"></p>\n<p>歡迎在 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/dzdqWWG2dE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> 上私信我們！<br>開發者：mr.mulle<br>美術：sekiapng</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n```",
